    "body": "Implements production-oriented Sign in with Google across API and web.\n\nHighlights:\n- verifies Google ID tokens server-side with Google's Java verifier and configured Web Client ID\n- stores stable provider subjects in a provider-neutral `user_auth_identities` model ready for Apple\n- explicitly distinguishes local-password accounts from federated-only accounts\n- creates the doFast user and wallet on first Google sign-in\n- safely links existing Gmail/Google Workspace accounts while refusing unsafe third-party-email auto-linking\n- returns the normal doFast JWT after provider authentication, keeping downstream authorization provider-agnostic\n- adds Google Identity Services buttons to login and registration\n- wires Docker/Vite configuration and documents setup/security rules\n- adds service tests for Google creation, returning identity, suspended/password-only boundaries and unsafe account linking\n\nConfiguration requires the same Google OAuth Web Client ID in `GOOGLE_AUTH_CLIENT_ID` and `VITE_GOOGLE_AUTH_CLIENT_ID`.",
